WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.750
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.842 --> 00:00:05.750
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.763 --> 00:00:10.013
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:13.132
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:17.053
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.092 --> 00:00:19.868
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:24.105
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:27.000
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:31.184
will distinguish activity output and outcome and complete a

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:35.461
brief using the supplied example Outcomes linked to this

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.382
activity EA-01 . 1 Translate an executive brief into

00:00:40.408 --> 00:00:47.066
agreed support priorities deliverables and review points EA-01 .

00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:51.934
4 Present options and consequences when demands compete including

00:00:51.974 --> 00:00:57.053
effects on preparation time cost wellbeing and required protective

00:00:57.105 --> 00:01:01.696
decisions Learning practice and acknowledgement are not an assessor

00:01:01.762 --> 00:01:03.933
